# A medal won (plan 13 · V9): a short, bright call of trumpet over glockenspiel sparkle, lighter than a Badge's.
# Plays once, then the music comes back. Original composition for this game.
title Medal Won
tempo 132
meter 4/4
reverb 0.36

track lead trumpet vol=0.85 rev=0.3
  o5 d8 f+8 a8 >d4 <a8 >d8 f+8 | e8 d8 c+8 e8 d2 |

track harmony horn vol=0.5 pan=-0.25 rev=0.3
  o5 a8 a8 f+8 a4 f+8 a8 >d8 | <g8 f+8 e8 g8 f+2 |

track sparkle glockenspiel vol=0.4 pan=0.35 rev=0.45
  o6 r8 a8 >d8 f+8 a4 r4 | o7 e8 c+8 <a8 >c+8 d2 |

track chords strings vol=0.4 pan=0.3 rev=0.42
  o4 (d f+ a)1 | (a c+ e)2 (d f+ a)2 |

track timpani timpani vol=0.5 rev=0.3
  o3 d4 a4 d4 a4 | a4 a4 d2 |

track drums kit vol=0.45 rev=0.2
  v90 (b c)4 s8 s8 b4 s8 s8 | s16 s16 s16 s16 b4 (b c)2 |
